### ===================================================================
### THE CODE OF HAMMURABI - NESTJS REST API TEST SUITE
### Base URL: http://localhost:3001/laws
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/laws

### 1. GET ALL LAWS (Semua Titah Hukum pada Prasasti)
### Menampilkan seluruh array titah hukum dari memory
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. GET LAW BY ID (Ambil Titah Tertentu - Success 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. GET LAW BY ID - NOT FOUND (Error Scenario 1: 404 NotFoundException)
### Mencari id yang tidak ada pada prasasti monolit
GET {{baseUrl}}/999
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. POST CREATE LAW (Pahat Titah Baru - Success 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pasalNum": 48,
  "title": "Moratorium Bunga Utang Banjir",
  "caste": "Awilum",
  "text": "Jika seseorang berutang dan badai menghancurkan hasil panennya, ia tidak berkewajiban membayar bunga pada tahun itu.",
  "logic": "Perlindungan debitur sektor pertanian Babilonia terhadap force majeure bencana alam sungai Efrat dan Tigris.",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 5. POST CREATE LAW - DUPLICATE PASAL (Error Scenario 2: 409 ConflictException)
### Mencoba memahat pasal 196 yang sudah ada pada prasasti
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pasalNum": 196,
  "title": "Duplikasi Hukum Lex Talionis",
  "caste": "Awilum",
  "text": "Pasal tiruan yang mencoba menduplikasi hukum mata ganti mata."
}

###

### 6. POST CREATE LAW - VALIDATION ERROR (Class-Validator Error: 400 Bad Request)
### Uji validasi: nomor pasal negatif, kasta tidak valid, teks terlalu pendek
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pasalNum": -5,
  "title": "X",
  "caste": "Alien",
  "text": "No"
}

###

### 7. PATCH UPDATE LAW (Perbarui Titah Hukum - Success 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hukum Lex Talionis (Revisi Resmi Mahkamah)",
  "logic": "Pembaharuan teks interpretasi hukum pembalasan setimpal antar-bangsawan Babilonia."
}

###

### 8. PATCH UPDATE LAW - NOT FOUND (Error Scenario: 404 NotFoundException)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mencoba Mengubah Titah Fiktif"
}

###

### 9. DELETE LAW (Hapus Titah dari Prasasti - Success 200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/4
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. DELETE LAW - NOT FOUND (Error Scenario: 404 NotFoundException)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/999
Accept: application/json
